warning[WL02014]: mutation in match guard
   ┌─ tests/linter/move_2024/mutation_in_match_guard.move:11:15
   │
11 │         _ if ({ value = value + 1; false }) => 0u64,
   │               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   │               │ │
   │               │ This may mutate state
   │               Match guard may mutate state
   │
   = Match guards may be run multiple times during match decisions, and should not be used to mutate state.
   = This warning can be suppressed with '#[allow(lint(mutation_in_match_guard))]' applied to the 'module' or module member ('const', 'fun', or 'struct')

